    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.icons\n\n### Description\n\nHaving mini.icons as the dependency for oil.nvim doesn't work without adding `opts = {}` to the dependency spec so it's not lazy loaded.\n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.10.0\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee https://github.com/stevearc/oil.nvim/issues/445 for steps to reproduce. \r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nI would expect plugin dependencies to work without adding extra options to them.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nOil opens the folder without any icons.",
