            "body": "Installing and enabling any of 'mini.nvim' modules is treated as user's responsibility. All it should require for users is to call `require('mini.icons').setup()`. How they do that (especially if it is lazy loaded), is not a 'mini.nvim' issue.\r\n\r\nClosing as not a 'mini.nvim' issue.",
